  "root_cause_analysis": "The model repeated state-modifying operations within the same turn, causing cumulative state divergence from ground truth. In Turn 1, the model identified the tire shop but only asked for confirmation rather than immediately executing set_navigation with the discovered address, deferring a mandatory operation.",
